---
title: Breaking Breadboards Brighton
layout: base.liquid
---
<header>
  <h2>A meetup for electronics enthuisasts</h2>
  <p>
  Breaking Breadboards is a welcoming group of tech tinkerers in Brighton (UK) interested in the intersection of
  hardware and software, no matter their experience level.
  </p>
</header>
<hr>
<section>
  <p>
  {%- assign next = collections.upcoming_events[0] -%}
  Next event:
  <time datetime="{{ next.date | htmlDateString }}">{{ next.date | readableDate }}</time>:
  <a href="{{ next.url }}">{{ next.data.title }}</a></p>
  <p><a href="{{ next.data.link }}" class="button">Join us on Meetup</a></p>
</section>
<section>
  <p>In the meantime come and chat on <b>#breaking-breadboards</b> on Silicon Brighton's Slack.</p>
  <a class="button" href="https://join.slack.com/t/silicon-brighton/shared_invite/zt-2rfg1b62d-JeOYQX5UYtgUcQkAvHGefQ">Join us on Slack</a>
  <p>
  You can also find us on <a href="https://www.instagram.com/breakingbreadboards/">Instagram</a> and
  <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/breaking-breadboards/">LinkedIn</a>.
  </p>
  <p>
  At Breaking Breadboards meetups, you'll have the opportunity to connect with like-minded individuals, share your
  projects, and learn from others. Whether you're interested in diving into the intricacies of microcontollers,
  exploring the latest in hardware, or simply looking for inspiration for your next project, you'll find it here.
  </p>
</section>
<hr>
<section>
  <h2>Upcoming events</h2>
  {%- for event in collections.upcoming_events -%}
  <h3>
    <time datetime="{{ event.date | htmlDateString }}">{{ event.date | readableDate }}</time>:
    <a href="{{ event.url }}">{{ event.data.title }}</a>
  </h3>
  <p>{{ event.content }}</p>
  {%- endfor -%}
</section>
<hr>
<section>
  <h2>Previous events</h2>
  <ul>
  {%- for event in collections.previous_events reversed -%}
  <li>
    <time datetime="{{ event.date | htmlDateString }}">{{ event.date | readableDate }}</time>:
    <a href="{{ event.url }}">{{ event.data.title }}</a>
  </li>
  {%- endfor -%}
  </ul>
</section>
